  "title": "The structural behaviour of stiffened composite panels subjected to in-plane shear loading",
  "abstract": "This work deals with a numerical investigation on the structural behaviour of stiffened composite panels subjected to in-plane shear loads in the post-buckling regime. The modelling approach takes into account large deformations and material nonlinearity effects by using a damage mechanics based progressive failure model.",
